hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
1272.1,Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr from Amra bint Abd ar-Rahman that A'isha
1272.2,Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr from Amra bint Abd ar-Rahman that A'isha
1273.1,Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that A'isha
1273.2,Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that A'isha
1274.1,Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Urwa ibn az- Zubayr that A'isha umm al-muminin told him that Aflah
1274.2,Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Urwa ibn az- Zubayr that A'isha umm al-muminin told him that Aflah
1275.1,Yahya related to me from Malik from Thawr ibn Zayd ad-Dili that Abdullah ibn Abbas said
1275.2,Yahya related to me from Malik from Thawr ibn Zayd ad-Dili that Abdullah ibn Abbas said
1276.1,Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Amr ibn ash- Sharid that Abdullah ibn Abbas was asked whether
1276.2,Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Amr ibn ash- Sharid that Abdullah ibn Abbas was asked whether
1277.1,"Yahya related to me from Malik thal Yahya ibn Said heard al-Qasim
ibn Muhammad and Sulayman ibn Yasar both mention that Yahya ibn Said
ibn al-As divorced the daughter of Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Hakam
irrevocably, so Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Hakam took her away A'isha umm
al-muminin sent to Marwan ibn al-Hakam who was the Amir of al-Madina
at that time. She said, ""Fear Allah and make him return the woman to
her house."" Marwan said in what Sulayman related, ''Abd ar-Rahman has
the upper hand over me."" Marwan said in what al-Qasim related, ""Hasn't
the affair of Fatima bint Qays reached you?"" A'isha said, ""You are
forced to mention the story of Fatima "" Marwan said, ""If you know that
evil, whatever evil there was between those two is enough for you.""
Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that the
Messenger of Allah, may Allah bless him and grant him peace, said,
""Try to go straight, although you will not be able to do so. Act, and
the best of your actions is the prayer. And only a mumin is constant
in his wudu."".)"
1277.2,Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said
1278.1,Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Salim ibn Abdullah ibn Umar informed him that A'isha umm al-muminin sent him away while he was being nursed to her sister Umm Kulthum bint Abi Bakr as-Siddiq and said
1278.2,Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Salim ibn Abdullah ibn Umar informed him that A'isha umm al-muminin sent him away while he was being nursed to her sister Umm Kulthum bint Abi Bakr as-Siddiq and said
1279.1,Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Safiyya bint Abi Ubayd told him that Hafsa
1279.2,Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Safiyya bint Abi Ubayd told him that Hafsa
1280.1,Yahya related to me from Malik from Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Qasim that his father told him that A'isha
1280.2,Yahya related to me from Malik from Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Qasim that his father told him that A'isha
1281.1,Yahya related to me from Malik that Ibrahim ibn Uqba asked Said ibn al-Musayyab about suckling. Said said
1281.2,Yahya related to me from Malik that Ibrahim ibn Uqba asked Said ibn al-Musayyab about suckling. Said said
1282.1,Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said said that he heard Said ibn al-Musayyab say
1282.2,Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said said that he heard Said ibn al-Musayyab say
1283.1,Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that he said
1283.2,
1284.1,Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that he was asked about the suckling of an older person. He said
1284.2,Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that he was asked about the suckling of an older person. He said
1285.1,Yahya related to me from Malik that Abdullah ibn Dinar said
1285.2,"Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Said
ibn al-Musayyab said, ""Divorce belongs to men, and women have the
idda."""
1286.1,Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that a man said to Abu Musa al-Ashari
1286.2,Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that a man said to Abu Musa al-Ashari
1287.1,Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Dinar from Sulayman ibn Yasar and from Urwa ibn az-Zubayr from A'isha umm al- muminin
1287.2,Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Dinar from Sulayman ibn Yasar and from Urwa ibn az-Zubayr from A'isha umm al- muminin
1288.1,Yahya related to me from Malik that Muhammad ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Nawfal said
1288.2,Yahya related to me from Malik that Muhammad ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Nawfal said
1289.1,Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr ibn Hazm from Amra bint Abd ar-Rahman that A'isha
1289.2,Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr ibn Hazm from Amra bint Abd ar-Rahman that A'isha
